imud (1.11.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  imud-mqtt refuses to start on a topic_prefix or ha_prefix holding the
  MQTT wildcard + or #, or on a qos other than 0, 1 or 2.
  "imud-mqtt --check-config" names any of these, and an upgrade runs it.

